    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447280/extras/f17ce167cc6999f875e86f9f00ce6c32.avif?t=1690147280\" /></div><br>Choose your favorite Pet and test your intelligence in a simple and fun maze game.<br>Take the pencil and draw the best way to solve the maze.<br><br>Maze game where you choose a Pet and draw the correct path to solve the maze in each level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All levels depict a different theme related to your Pet<br></li><li>Stylized graphics (made by a children's comic artist)<br></li><li>Relaxing soundtrack<br></li><li>Made for computer</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1447280/extras/f17ce167cc6999f875e86f9f00ce6c32.avif?t=1690147280\" /></div><br>Choose your favorite Pet and test your intelligence in a simple and fun maze game.<br>Take the pencil and draw the best way to solve the maze.<br><br>Maze game where you choose a Pet and draw the correct path to solve the maze in each level.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>All levels depict a different theme related to your Pet<br></li><li>Stylized graphics (made by a children's comic artist)<br></li><li>Relaxing soundtrack<br></li><li>Made for computer</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Unique game that brings the aesthetics of children's maze books to the digital world. Are you ready to draw?",
